{"slug":"tt-y-b","ar":"ط ي ب","total":50,"core":"goodness; purity","forms":[{"ar":"طَيِّبَٰت","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":21,"gloss":"good things","word":null,"ex":{"s":23,"a":51,"p":5,"ar":["يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","ٱلرُّسُلُ","كُلُوا۟","مِنَ","ٱلطَّيِّبَـٰتِ","وَٱعْمَلُوا۟","صَـٰلِحًا ۖ","إِنِّى","بِمَا","تَعْمَلُونَ","عَلِيمٌ"],"en":"[Allah said], \"O messengers, eat from the good foods and work righteousness. Indeed, I, of what you do, am Knowing"}},{"ar":"طَيِّب","kind":"adjective","form":null,"count":16,"gloss":"good, pure","word":null,"ex":{"s":22,"a":24,"p":3,"ar":["وَهُدُوٓا۟","إِلَى","ٱلطَّيِّبِ","مِنَ","ٱلْقَوْلِ","وَهُدُوٓا۟","إِلَىٰ","صِرَٰطِ","ٱلْحَمِيدِ"],"en":"And they had been guided [in worldly life] to good speech, and they were guided to the path of the Praiseworthy"}},{"ar":"طَيِّبَة","kind":"adjective","form":null,"count":9,"gloss":"good, pure","word":null,"ex":{"s":3,"a":38,"p":12,"ar":["هُنَالِكَ","دَعَا","زَكَرِيَّا","رَبَّهُۥ ۖ","قَالَ","رَبِّ","هَبْ","لِى","مِن","لَّدُنكَ","ذُرِّيَّةً","طَيِّبَةً ۖ","إِنَّكَ","سَمِيعُ","ٱلدُّعَآءِ"],"en":"At that, Zechariah called upon his Lord, saying, \"My Lord, grant me from Yourself a good offspring. Indeed, You are the Hearer of supplication"}},{"ar":"طَابَ","kind":"verb","form":1,"count":3,"gloss":"to be good, pleasing","word":null,"ex":{"s":4,"a":4,"p":6,"ar":["وَءَاتُوا۟","ٱلنِّسَآءَ","صَدُقَـٰتِهِنَّ","نِحْلَةً ۚ","فَإِن","طِبْنَ","لَكُمْ","عَن","شَىْءٍ","مِّنْهُ","نَفْسًا","فَكُلُوهُ","هَنِيٓـًٔا","مَّرِيٓـًٔا"],"en":"And give the women [upon marriage] their [bridal] gifts graciously. But if they give up willingly to you anything of it, then take it in satisfaction and ease"}},{"ar":"طُوبَىٰ","kind":"verbal noun","form":null,"count":1,"gloss":"blessedness","word":null,"ex":{"s":13,"a":29,"p":5,"ar":["ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوا۟","وَعَمِلُوا۟","ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ","طُوبَىٰ","لَهُمْ","وَحُسْنُ","مَـَٔابٍ"],"en":"Those who have believed and done righteous deeds - a good state is theirs and a good return"}}],